{"overview":"ساساکی یک کارمند حقوق‌بگیر پرکار است که با سختی‌های کار در شرکت دست و پنجه نرم می‌کند و سیگار و خدمات شاد و لبخند یامادا، کارمند سوپرمارکت مورد علاقه‌اش، او را سرپا نگه می‌دارد. اما یک شب پس از یک شیفت طاقت‌فرسا، دیر به سر کار می‌رسد و می‌بیند یامادا هیچ جا نیست. وقتی جایی برای سیگار کشیدن ندارد، روحیه‌اش تحلیل می‌رود - تا اینکه یک زن جوان سوراخ سوراخ به او می‌گوید: «می‌توانی اینجا سیگار بکشی.»","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sasaki is an overworked salaryman drifting through the corporate grind, sustained by cigarettes and the cheerful service and smile of Yamada, the clerk at his favorite supermarket. But one night after a grueling shift, he arrives late to find Yamada nowhere to be seen. With nowhere left to smoke, his spirits sink—until a pierced young woman calls out to him: “You can smoke here.”","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/zcDIM3uRmO9XIiujy5CHiH1iaQO.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"佐藤拓也","role":"Sasaki (voice)","photo":"/xZgoTs6DOSneHkoOWL751pQzLru.jpg"},{"name":"سینا هوشیکی","role":"Yamada (voice)","photo":"/Ajo0KjBdtYPH6FLjxeexHEStk3T.jpg"},{"name":"行成とあ","role":"Gotō (voice)","photo":"/aR11JLaHVeTM1RgGULsU9zIiaZs.jpg"},{"name":"豊口めぐみ","role":"Ōno (voice)","photo":"/qrnzkvoaODEplqhtkcyDgUa3Qtp.jpg"},{"name":"安田陸矢","role":"Obata (voice)","photo":"/eZCxGqkEibJkUEhLO9Xp4zNDlY3.jpg"},{"name":"یوکو هیکاسا","role":"Maezawa (voice)","photo":"/mP3bj0s1gqJ6tCKFLhu4b1CkJj7.jpg"},{"name":"高橋伸也","role":"Suzuki (voice)","photo":"/19DN4yrD9c3E7BWthVEqvwhQNdb.jpg"}],"trailer":"kynbQYIVK7I","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/296286/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"bu